    "sections": [
      {
        "title": "ProduceBlockV4 出价接口",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "提案：验证者客户端直接联系构建者，并通过扩展 ProduceBlockV4，将出价提供给所连接的信标节点。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:01:53",
            "seek": 113.0
          },
          {
            "text": "顾虑：增加验证者客户端复杂性，可能形成不理想的协议外市场；Nico 指出 payload attributes 时序不匹配，以及 slot 后期调用 API 的问题。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:08:37",
            "seek": 517.0
          },
          {
            "text": "信标节点拒绝出价时，回退到 P2P 出价或本地构建，仅尽力纳入。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:14:29",
            "seek": 869.0
          },
          {
            "text": "尚未就合并达成共识；Jihoon 建议继续异步设计讨论，以 Hoodi 为目标。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:15:22",
            "seek": 922.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "ePBS 漏 slot 的付款顺序",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "两个竞争的 PR，consensus-specs #5694 和 #5695，处理构建者赢得出价、退出后又发生漏 slot 时的付款问题。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:16:07",
            "seek": 967.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Michael（Lighthouse）倾向于 Nico 的 PR #5695，Potuz 也接受；更严格的请求顺序被认为对未来扩展更安全。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:17:53",
            "seek": 1073.0
          },
          {
            "text": "合并 #5695 会改变共识，但 Nico 指出客户端仍通过当前 beta-2 测试向量，因此不一定需要规范发布；合并后再讨论发布，Potuz 将提交 Prysm PR。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:23:13",
            "seek": 1393.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Gloas Beacon API",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "有 6 个开放的 Gloas Beacon API PR：#638、#641、#655、#657、#659、#615；Nico 已全部批准，并在 Lodestar 实现。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:20:22",
            "seek": 1222.0
          },
          {
            "text": "目标在 Sepolia 分叉前合并这些 PR，客户端实现为 Hoodi 做好准备。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:20:44",
            "seek": 1244.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "FOCIL 客户端镜像",
        "kind": "highlights",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Lodestar 和 Teku 已提供 FOCIL 镜像，Lighthouse 正在开发。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:23:47",
            "seek": 1427.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "决策",
        "kind": "decisions",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "合并 consensus-specs PR #5695，即 Nico 对请求顺序的调整，处理漏 slot 时的构建者付款。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:19:40",
            "seek": 1180.0
          },
          {
            "text": "暂不合并 ProduceBlockV4 出价接口，继续异步设计讨论，以 Hoodi 为目标。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:15:22",
            "seek": 922.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "行动项",
        "kind": "actions",
        "items": [
          {
            "owner": "Luca (Vero)",
            "text": "Luca 为 ProduceBlockV4 出价设计开启异步讨论线程。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:15:56",
            "seek": 956.0
          },
          {
            "owner": "All CL teams (Lighthouse, Teku, Prysm)",
            "text": "在 Sepolia 分叉前审查 6 个 Gloas Beacon API PR，并批准或提出意见。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:21:10",
            "seek": 1270.0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "目标与时间",
        "kind": "targets",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "在 Sepolia 分叉前合并 Gloas Beacon API PR，实现为 Hoodi 做好准备。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:20:44",
            "seek": 1244.0
          },
          {
            "text": "consensus-specs #5695 合并后，再讨论共识层规范发布。",
            "sourceTimestamp": "00:23:13",
            "seek": 1393.0
          }
        ]
      }
